Bonsai-27B and Qwen3.6-27B
------------------------
The GGUF exporter uses Prism ML's Bonsai-27B-Q1_0.gguf, derived from Qwen3.6-27B.
The exporter adds circuit and program snapshot tensors and metadata. It copies
the original tensor payloads and retains their metadata entries.

