stories260K and guest runtime
----------------------------
The guest ELFs and the corresponding story snapshots embed int4 weights
derived from Andrej Karpathy's stories260K through QwenPU's self-distillation
and vector export. The tinyllamas model card labels the weights MIT.
https://huggingface.co/karpathy/tinyllamas/tree/0bd21da7698eaf29a0d7de3992de8a46ef624add

For the companion llama2.c project, see licenses/llama2.c-MIT.txt.
